    <text><table><thead><tr><th>System</th><th>Result</th><th>Finding</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Gastrointestinal</td><td>Negative</td><td>Early nausea and loose stools resolved; no bleeding</td></tr><tr><td>Neurological</td><td>Negative</td><td>No headache, tremor, or restlessness</td></tr><tr><td>Constitutional</td><td>Positive</td><td>Fatigue persists; appetite slightly better</td></tr><tr><td>Psychiatric</td><td>Positive</td><td>Low mood and interest, early waking; no suicidal thoughts, elevated mood, or racing thoughts</td></tr></tbody></table><paragraph>4 systems reviewed. [S]</paragraph></text>

  </section>
</component>

